w_0             | 0.5000       | 0.5116       | 0.0515      
w_1             | 1.5000       | 1.5352       | 0.5057      
w_2             | -2.0000      | -2.0453      | -0.7086     
w_3             | 0.8000       | 0.8399       | 0.2836      
w_4             | 4.0000       | 4.0203       | 1.3734      
w_5             | -3.5000      | -3.4866      | -1.1952     
